  "details": "The newly added `MonoMod.Backports.dll` in `3.11.0-beta.1` gets referenced in UdonSharp's compile.\n\nThis prevents UdonSharp compile when a class whose assembly is in a scope relevant to UdonSharp (eg `Assembly-CSharp`) uses a type defined in both `mscorlib` and `MonoMod.Backports` such as `ArrayPool<T>`. \n\n```\n\nerror CS0433: The type 'ArrayPool<T>' exists in both 'MonoMod.Backports, Version=1.1.2.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null' and 'mscorlib, Version=4.0.0.0, Culture=neutral,\n\n```",
